# The yggdrasil image that ginnungagap runs.
#
# This file is tracked, and that is deliberate. The pinned tag is the deployment
# record: every change to it is a commit, so there is a history of what was
# running and when, and a rollback is the previous value plus a redeploy.
#
# The tag is always the git SHA the image was built from, never `latest`. An
# immutable tag makes it possible to tell which build is actually running, and it
# is what makes `pull_policy: missing` in compose.yaml safe.
#
# Nothing secret belongs here. Registry credentials live in the Docker credential
# store, not in this file.
#
# Empty until the first bootstrap, at which point compose.yaml fails with an
# explanation rather than starting something unintended. See "Bootstrapping
# yggdrasil" in README.md.
YGGDRASIL_IMAGE=
